],"lontana":"itc-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","alternative":[{"codice":"la","nome":"Latin","termine":"texō","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"itc-pro","nome":"Proto-Italic","termine":"*teksō","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"","categoria":"ereditato"}],"testo":"From alteration of Middle French tissir, from Old French tissir, formed analogically from the original tistre, itself from Latin texō, from Proto-Italic *teksō, either from Proto-Indo-European *tḗtḱ-ti or from *teḱ-se-ti, both from *teḱ- (“to beget, produce”). The original past participle was tissu."}]}